--  The configuration pragmas of the userland library
--  (user_library.gpr, #1067). They must agree with every program that
--  imports it, since the binder checks restrictions across the whole
--  program: today every program has just this one.
--
--  The userland run-time system has no tasking, and without this a
--  function that returns a limited class-wide object needs its task
--  activation support.
pragma Restrictions (No_Tasking);
